# The ChromaDB index is a single ~111 MB SQLite file, which plain git refuses
# ("exceeds 100 MB"). Hugging Face Spaces need it *in the image*, because Space
# disk is not persistent, so the index is pushed to the Space repo with LFS.
#
# data/chroma_db is also gitignored (the file is far too large for GitHub), so
# it needs `git add -f` on top of this tracking. See DEPLOY_HF_SPACE.md §6.
*.sqlite3 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text